[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:08.08]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:12.94]left a single note and went on their way
[00:18.22]I never got their name until the credits
[00:22.80]now it plays here every single day
[00:27.64]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:37.60]One note at a time
[00:42.22]from people passing through
[00:47.00]a name beside a line
[00:51.06]and part of it is you
[00:57.00]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
